2. National partners from state institutions and civil society organizations have limited capacity for development and implementation of gender policy; 
3. Capacity of UNDP programme and project staff on gender mainstreaming need to be improved in thematic areas;
4. UN holistic approach in gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment needs further improvement</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
