2. 
Capacity of UNDP staff in gender mainstreaming and women&#x2019;s empowerment is sufficient in implementing gender equality principles in thematic areas and Gender equality objectives reflected properly in program&#x2019;s AWPs, and resource allocation for GE is increased;
